\q1 \v 1 \w How|strong="H349"\w*\f + \fr 4:1 \ft This chapter is an acrostic poem, each verse beginning with the successive letters of the Hebrew alphabet.\f* \w the gold|strong="H2091"\w* \w has become tarnished|strong="H6004"\w*,
